        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Advisory Team will provide an opportunity for an employee to learn in an environment to successfully perform the job and plays a part in the total approach to improving job performance. This team will also promote the foundation for an individual's developments towards future growth of the organization.",
